      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAW MYSTIQUE (7) flew the lids with a slick early split last time and went on to clock 25.07 as a strongly fancied winner over 440m at this track. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. STOMP SHUFFLE (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (30.43) in a Grade 5 at Wentworth Park. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. BOHEMIAN LASS (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 24.75 beating Zipping Kesha. One of the leading chances again. MAGIC MANIA (8) is a last start winner and can go on with it.",
